Package: ubuntu-backup
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 python3,
 python3-gi,
 python3-gi-cairo,
 gir1.2-gtk-3.0,
 libayatana-appindicator3-1,
 gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1
Description: configuration and full-home backup utility for Ubuntu
 Ubuntu Backup captures system configuration, development environments, and
 optionally a full home directory snapshot. It provides a GTK tray interface,
 scheduled backups, external-drive storage, and guarded restore workflows.
 .
 Backups may contain credentials and other private data. This application does
 not encrypt its snapshots; keep backup drives physically secure.

Package: ubuntu-backup-system
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 python3
Suggests: ubuntu-backup
Description: privileged system capture helper for Ubuntu Backup
 Captures root-owned and other-user configuration into a verified cache inside
 the invoking user's Ubuntu Backup workspace. It is intended for the strict
 Ubuntu Backup snap and for the packaged GUI.
 .
 The helper runs only through pkexec or the ubuntu-backup-system@.timer systemd
 timer. It never edits /etc while capturing; restore actions remain explicit.
